      "content": "Looking at your code, the issue is that `PRCommitSelector` is trying to call `this.api.repo.commits()` which doesn't exist in your API. Also, the API instance isn't being properly passed and initialized.\n\nHere are the fixes:\n\n## 1. First, add the missing `commits` method to the API\n\n```js client/src/api/api.js\n    repo: {\n      branches() {\n        return API.get('/api/projects/repo/branches')\n      },\n      changes({ from_branch, to_branch }) {\n        return API.get(`/api/projects/repo/changes?from_branch=${from_branch}&to_branch=${to_branch}`)\n      },\n      commitChanges({ from_commit, to_commit }) {\n        return API.get(`/api/projects/repo/commit-changes?from_commit=${from_commit}&to_commit=${to_commit}`)\n      },\n      commits({ branch, limit = 80 }) {\n        const branchParam = branch ? `&branch=${encodeURIComponent(branch)}` : ''\n        return API.get(`/api/projects/repo/commits?limit=${limit}${branchParam}`)\n      }\n    },\n```\n\n## 2. Fix `PRCommitSelector.vue`\n\n```vue client/src/components/repo/PRCommitSelector.vue\n<script setup>\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full\">\n    <!-- Mode toggle: branch vs commit -->\n    <div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Compare by:</span>\n      <div class=\"join\">\n        <button class=\"join-item btn btn-xs\" \n          :class=\"mode === 'branch' ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-ghost'\"\n          @click=\"mode = 'branch'\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-code-branch\"></i> Branch\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"join-item btn btn-xs\"\n          :class=\"mode === 'commit' ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-ghost'\"\n          @click=\"mode = 'commit'\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-code-commit\"></i> Commit\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Branch mode -->\n    <div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center\" v-if=\"mode === 'branch'\">\n      <slot />\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Commit mode -->\n    <div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center flex-wrap\" v-if=\"mode === 'commit'\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Branch (for commit list)</span>\n        <select class=\"select select-xs select-bordered w-40\" v-model=\"selectedBranch\" @change=\"loadCommits\">\n          <option value=\"\">-- HEAD --</option>\n          <option v-for=\"b in branches\" :key=\"b\" :value=\"b\">{{ b }}</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\" v-if=\"commits.length\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">From commit (newer)</span>\n        <select class=\"select select-xs select-bordered max-w-xs\" v-model=\"fromCommit\" @change=\"emitCommit\">\n          <option value=\"\">-- select --</option>\n          <option v-for=\"c in commits\" :key=\"c.commit\" :value=\"c.commit\" :title=\"c.message\">\n            {{ c.label }}\n          </option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\" v-if=\"commits.length\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">To commit (base)</span>\n        <select class=\"select select-xs select-bordered max-w-xs\" v-model=\"toCommit\" @change=\"emitCommit\">\n          <option value=\"\">-- select --</option>\n          <option v-for=\"c in commits\" :key=\"c.commit\" :value=\"c.commit\" :title=\"c.message\">\n            {{ c.label }}\n          </option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-end pb-1\" v-if=\"commits.length && fromCommit && toCommit\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-xs btn-primary\" @click=\"emitCommit\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate\"></i> Compare\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-slate-400\" v-if=\"loadingCommits\">\n        <span class=\"loading loading-spinner loading-xs\"></span> Loading commits...\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: ['branches', 'projectApi'],\n  emits: ['commit-compare', 'mode-change'],\n  data() {\n    return {\n      mode: 'branch',\n      selectedBranch: '',\n      commits: [],\n      fromCommit: '',\n      toCommit: '',\n      loadingCommits: false\n    }\n  },\n  watch: {\n    mode(val) {\n      this.$emit('mode-change', val)\n      if (val === 'commit' && !this.commits.length) {\n        this.loadCommits()\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  methods: {\n    async loadCommits() {\n      if (!this.projectApi) {\n        console.error('Project API not available')\n        return\n      }\n      this.loadingCommits = true\n      this.fromCommit = ''\n      this.toCommit = ''\n      try {\n        const branch = this.selectedBranch || undefined\n        this.commits = await this.projectApi.repo.commits({ branch, limit: 80 })\n      } catch (ex) {\n        console.error('Error loading commits', ex)\n        this.commits = []\n      } finally {\n        this.loadingCommits = false\n      }\n    },\n    emitCommit() {\n      if (!this.fromCommit || !this.toCommit) return\n      this.$emit('commit-compare', {\n        fromCommit: this.fromCommit,\n        toCommit: this.toCommit\n      })\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n## 3. Fix `PRView.vue` to pass the correct API\n\nUpdate the PRCommitSelector usage in the template:\n\n```vue client/src/components/repo/PRView.vue\n        <!-- Compare controls -->\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap items-end\">\n          <PRCommitSelector\n            :branches=\"repoBranches?.branches\"\n            :projectApi=\"api\"\n            @mode-change=\"onCompareModeChange\"\n            @commit-compare=\"onCommitCompare\"\n          >\n            <!-- Branch selectors rendered inside commit selector slot -->\n            <PRBranchSelectoor \n              :fromBranch=\"fromBranchSelected\" \n              :toBranch=\"toBranchSelected\" \n              @select=\"onBranchChanged\" \n              :branches=\"repoBranches?.branches\" \n            />\n          </PRCommitSelector>\n\n          <button class=\"btn btn-xs\" @click=\"refreshSummary\" :disabled=\"loading\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"grow\"></div>\n          <PRFileViewModeSelector :messageCount=\"messages.length\" @select=\"onSelectFileOption\" />\n        </div>\n```\n\n**Key changes:**\n1. \u2705 Added `repo.commits()` API endpoint\n2. \u2705 Changed prop from `api` to `projectApi` in `PRCommitSelector` (clearer naming)\n3. \u2705 Ensured `initializeProjectContext()` is called to load the correct API instance\n4. \u2705 Fixed error handling when API is not available",
